{"title":"Career Roadmap · Homeopathy Product Consultant","role":"Homeopathy Product Consultant","summary":"A Homeopathy Product Consultant applies knowledge of homoeopathic medicine, healthcare products, patient/customer communication, product information, and healthcare business practices to support the appropriate use, positioning, education, or distribution of homoeopathic products.","facts":{"Current degree":"BHMS (Homoeopathy)","Course":"Homoeopathic Medicine & Surgery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Homeopathy Product Consultant applies knowledge of homoeopathic medicine, healthcare products, patient/customer communication, product information, and healthcare business practices to support the appropriate use, positioning, education, or distribution of homoeopathic products."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the organization, the role may involve:"},{"type":"h","text":"Homoeopathic product education"},{"type":"h","text":"Product portfolio management"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer/patient education"},{"type":"h","text":"Product information support"},{"type":"h","text":"Retailer and distributor support"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare professional engagement"},{"type":"h","text":"Product training"},{"type":"h","text":"Market research"},{"type":"h","text":"Product documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical content development"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality and compliance coordination"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales-support activities"},{"type":"h","text":"New-product research"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Possible employers include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Homoeopathic pharmaceutical companies"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare product companies"},{"type":"h","text":"AYUSH organizations"},{"type":"h","text":"Retail pharmacy chains"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness organizations"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare distributors"},{"type":"h","text":