ca"},{"type":"h","text":"Organon of Medicine"},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to understand both healthcare fundamentals and the principles/framework of homoeopathic practice."}]},{"heading":"Clinical Years","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Obstetrics & Gynecology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pediatrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Psychiatry"},{"type":"h","text":"Community medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Homoeopathic Materia Medica"},{"type":"h","text":"Repertory"},{"type":"h","text":"Organon"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical case-taking"},{"type":"p","text":"For a product-oriented career, pay particular attention to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product composition/information"},{"type":"h","text":"Indications and intended use"},{"type":"h","text":"Contraindications and precautions"},{"type":"h","text":"Product quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage/formulation information"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse-event awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory requirements"}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Use the internship to build both clinical credibility and product knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient history"},{"type":"h","text":"Case-taking"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Case documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient counselling"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacy/Product Environment"},{"type":"h","text":"Where available, understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product categories"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing processes"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Label information"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage"},{"type":"h","text":"Batch information"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality-control p