Training & Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer / Professional Feedback"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Performance Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Improvement"}]},{"heading":"Product Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to understand a product beyond its name."},{"type":"h","text":"For each product, understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product category"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulation"},{"type":"h","text":"Ingredients/components"},{"type":"h","text":"Strength/concentration where applicable"},{"type":"h","text":"Intended use"},{"type":"h","text":"Directions for use"},{"type":"h","text":"Warnings"},{"type":"h","text":"Precautions"},{"type":"h","text":"Contraindications where applicable"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Target customer"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory classification"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality standards"},{"type":"h","text":"Available evidence"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional consultant should distinguish clearly between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product information","Evidence","Marketing claim"]},{"type":"p","text":"These are not automatically the same thing."}]},{"heading":"Homoeopathic Materia Medica","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BHMS students should develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Materia Medica"},{"type":"h","text":"Remedy profiles"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical presentations"},{"type":"h","text":"Repertory"},{"type":"h","text":"Case-taking"},{"type":"h","text":"Remedy selection principles"},{"type":"p","text":"For product-industry work, this knowledge helps in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product education"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional training"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Product information"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare professional engagement"},{"type":"p","text":"However, product promotion should remain consistent with applicable professional and advertising requirements."}]},{"heading":"Healthcare Product Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important skills is translating technical product information into understandable communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Example workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Product Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical / Scientific Interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Clear Product Explanation"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliant Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Different audiences require different communication."},{"type":"table","header":["Audience","Communication Style"],"rows":[[{"text":"Physician/Practitioner"},{"text":"Technical and evidence-oriented"}],[{"text":"Pharmacist"},{"text":"Product/formulation focused"}],[{"text":"Distributor"},{"text":"Commercial + product information"}],[{"text":"Retailer"},{"text":"Product availability + customer information"}],[{"text":"Consumer"},{"text":"Simple, responsible information"}],[{"text":"Sales Team"},{"text":"Product training + communication"}],[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Market + business insights"}]]}]},{"heading":"Product Training","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A Product Consultant may train:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales representatives"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacy staff"},{"type":"h","text":"Distributors"},{"type":"h","text":"Retailers"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer-support teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare professionals, where appropriate and permitted"},{"type":"h","text":"Training topics may include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Product characteristics"},{"type":"h","text":"Appropriate product information"},{"type":"h","text":"Frequently asked questions"},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication guidelines"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer objections"}]},{"hea